Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.51,0:00:15.63,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}One Dream One Wish{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.51,0:00:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}One Dream One Wish{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.68,0:00:20.56,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}kanaetai nara Over The Top{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.68,0:00:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If you want to make it \Ncome true, Over The Top{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.69,0:00:28.23,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,ONE PIECE - LAND OF WANO ARC
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.49,0:00:40.12,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}mitakoto mo nai sekai mezashi{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.49,0:00:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Setting out into the unknown world{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:45.29,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}araburu namikaze koete{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Weathering rough wind and waves{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.33,0:00:50.00,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}tsukisusumanakya dame sa \Nichibannori shitain da{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.33,0:00:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I have to keep going because \NI want to get there first{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:56.26,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}shinpai toka atomawashi \Ndouse shoubu ichika bachika{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Worry later since it's \Nall sink or swim anyway{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.39,0:01:02.81,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}aite ga dekaku mietara{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.39,0:01:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}When your opponent looks daunting{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:07.90,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}kokoro ga chijinderu shouko{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's a sign that your heart is shrinking{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.35,0:01:10.44,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}nigeru nante choisu wa nai{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.35,0:01:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Running away is not a choice{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.48,0:01:12.57,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}ippo soba e chikadukun da{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.48,0:01:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Take one step closer{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.61,0:01:15.07,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}namaiki tte homekotoba?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.61,0:01:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Being called insolent's a compliment, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.07,0:01:19.41,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}kitsui toki hodo warattoke{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.07,0:01:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}When things become tough, \Nthat's when you should laugh{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.95,0:01:25.37,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}atarashii ashita sagashi ni ikitai no nara{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.95,0:01:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If you want to look for a new tomorrow{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:30.63,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}tobikkiri no jishin wo migaite{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Polish your unique confidence{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.67,0:01:35.17,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}tabi wo shita ashiato ga{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.67,0:01:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Until your footsteps{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.21,0:01:38.84,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}sou! chizu ni kawaru made{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.21,0:01:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Yes! Become a map{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:43.39,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}atarashii Horizon hora susunde kita bun{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}A new horizon, look, how far you've come{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.43,0:01:48.44,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}mabushisa to nanido ga joushou{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.43,0:01:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's brighter and the \Nlevel of difficulty rises{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.81,0:01:53.15,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}yumeutsutsu de okose Hurricane{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.81,0:01:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Live in your dream and raise a hurricane{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.19,0:01:57.99,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}saa! chaato kakimidase{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.19,0:01:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Now! Stir up the rankings{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.03,0:02:02.28,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}One Dream One Wish{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.03,0:02:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}One Dream One Wish{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:06.79,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}yume wa nigenai... zenbu Knock out{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dreams don't run away... Knock everything out{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:09.16,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Over The Top{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Over The Top{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The first Haki he showed me was\Na very high level one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.73,0:02:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now you're getting serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.03,0:04:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"A Big Turnover!\NThe Three-Sword Style Overcomes Danger!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Feels like I'm missing something...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.72,0:05:16.69,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,EXCAVATION LABOR CAMP, UDON
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't good practice at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.83,0:05:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're not good enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.41,0:05:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you have someone stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.95,0:05:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can fight me if you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.21,0:05:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That bastard... He's pushing his luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.39,0:05:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think you still don't understand\Nthe situation you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.69,0:06:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hell hasn't been unleashed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry-{\i1}bear{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.96,0:06:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I defeat Straw Hat,\Ncan I get the prisoners' dumplings all to myself-{\i1}bear{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.33,0:06:19.67,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,BEAR-MAN - A GIFTER\NBEAR SMILE FRUIT
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, you can. Rock the place up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's my Queen-{\i1}bear{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.89,0:06:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I became 100 times more motivated-{\i1}bear{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.78,0:06:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so greedy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.67,0:06:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let you have the dumplings!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This time, it's a bear Gifter...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.10,0:06:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's quite pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go-{\i1}bear{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.36,0:06:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.45,0:06:59.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those punches...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.59,0:07:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...aren't working at all-{\i1}bear{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Straw hat man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Outside he looks pretty, \Nbut he's still a bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They say that bears' claws are\Npowerful enough to sever human bodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.15,0:07:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.18,0:07:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your body's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.35,0:07:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.19,0:07:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what-{\i1}bear{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.61,0:07:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is more like it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:31.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because Kaido's body is even tougher!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Without laying a finger...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.67,0:07:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Send him flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn, when I try to use force,\NI can't help hitting them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What have you been...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.49,0:08:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.95,0:08:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Dogstorm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter, Kin'emon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We have a huge problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:28.38,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,AN ABANDONED VILLAGE, KURI\NKIN'EMON AND MINK MUSKETEERS
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They found out about\Nthe flyer with the symbol and the moon tattoo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.01,0:08:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, and now it's a big mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What should we do, Duke-{\i1}sama{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.39,0:08:42.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We were handing them out covertly...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I do not know how it leaked...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.82,0:08:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We wrote it in the coded symbol\Nin case it fell into unintended hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:59.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But they somehow know the link between\Nthe ankle tattoo and this flyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.91,0:09:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now in the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard our allies are getting caught\Nby Kaido and Orochi's underlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.67,0:09:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're under arrest! You're under arrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop resisting, you rebel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I found the flyer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's got the moon tattoo, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.44,0:09:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those who have the mark on their ankles\Nare rebels!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.69,0:09:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If anyone sees it, let us know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.32,0:09:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rumors spread quickly...\NEveryone in the capital already knows about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We shouldn't take our time\Npatrolling bathhouses now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.18,0:09:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.16,0:09:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're Germa. Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.31,0:10:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go to hell, Germa 66!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.10,0:10:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Soba Mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it Stealth Black's transmission device?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hang on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Only Stealth Black could've done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take him down next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.17,0:10:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't just my fault.\NYou also let them get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.43,0:10:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.05,0:10:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the night of the Fire \NFestival... Habu Port...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.31,0:10:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And the Reversed Crescent Moon,\Nthe symbol of rebellion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Komurasaki-{\i1}dayu{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Boss Kyoshiro...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.77,0:11:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Komurasaki's wake has been canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If so many upset people like them pour in,\Nthere might be an accident...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:46.91,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,A BROTHEL, FLOWER CAPITAL
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.91,0:11:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think the funeral tomorrow will be\Neven more crowded...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.29,0:11:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--May she rest in peace!\N--Komurasaki-{\i1}dayu{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.54,0:11:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Komurasaki!\N--Komurasaki-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quite a lot of people\Nhold a grudge against you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.89,0:12:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They don't know what they're talking about...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.52,0:12:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kyoshiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:20.40,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,KYOSHIRO SLASHED KOMURASAKI TO DEATH
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.51,0:12:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There was no other way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The one who'll suffer the biggest loss...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:55.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.23,0:13:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0} is frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess that it's because of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.14,0:13:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.94,0:13:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0}... has not \Ncome out of his room...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.96,0:13:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It cannot be helped.\NHis love interest, Komurasaki, was killed in front of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.54,0:13:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On top of that, there is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.87,0:13:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This symbol points to a rebellion\Nagainst Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0} and Kaido-{\i1}sama{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The fire suggests the Fire Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.64,0:14:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The two birds indicate twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.42,0:14:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The {\i1}habu{\i0} snake implies Habu \NPort, the rendezvous point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.30,0:14:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That means some people will raid Onigashima\Non the night of the Fire Festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.93,0:14:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But we found out beforehand, so all we need to do\Nis find the rebels and keep them under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.86,0:14:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And we will teach them the hard way\Nwho reigns over the Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing will be solved by arguing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:55.10,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,EBISU TOWN
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.47,0:14:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.90,0:14:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.76,0:14:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have anything to talk to you about!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.60,0:15:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what's up, kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like you're having fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.67,0:15:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.50,0:15:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fighting? That's not good...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.71,0:15:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, you can have this, \Nso go someplace else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.26,0:15:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Yay!\N--Thank you, Yasu-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not gonna give up on my crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:22.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go save them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.79,0:15:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you out of your mind?\NIt'll be like you're turning yourself in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Our allies who wanna take down Orochi\Nare getting caught one after another...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...ever since your crew messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.89,0:15:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.48,0:15:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That little bear and the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...definitely told them about our plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.11,0:15:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bepo and the others would rather die than talk!\NDon't underestimate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.70,0:15:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! That's exactly what \Nthe enemies want, Tra-guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.41,0:16:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't tell me what to do, Blackleg-{\i1}ya{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.54,0:16:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Both of you, simmer down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one who needs to cool your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.35,0:16:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got to trust your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.82,0:16:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the most untrustworthy person I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.01,0:16:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Happy punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.52,0:16:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the...\NHe's the guy from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Soba Mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nami-{\i1}sa{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The shape of Nami-{\i1}san{\i0}'s body\Nwas like a magnificent mighty river flowing...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.70,0:16:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sanji! Why is he here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.89,0:16:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is he wearing?!\NYou've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't see anything at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.34,0:16:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How did you get punched\Nto end up looking like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you trying to run?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.39,0:17:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You must eliminate those who got caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To silence them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.47,0:17:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.85,0:17:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what we do in the ninja world!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're scary, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.95,0:17:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're not doing this for fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For two decades...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.88,0:17:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For 20 years, we've been waiting for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.27,0:17:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we fail now, there \Nwon't be another chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.81,0:17:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.65,0:17:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kan-{\i1}sama{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.11,0:17:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Things do not always go the way you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.08,0:18:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can relate to your frustration!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.29,0:18:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But without help from these people\Nwho miraculously have the same purpose as us,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.05,0:18:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,we cannot fulfill Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.89,0:18:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.43,0:18:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard your voice outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You all have good voices!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! You're so beautiful!\NAre you a goddess?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.41,0:18:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like to come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.80,0:18:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.43,0:18:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...you're Shinobu-{\i1}chan{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kanjuro-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.01,0:19:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.15,0:19:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then this is the real thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.65,0:19:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is what everyone's \Ntalking about in the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.36,0:19:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.82,0:19:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Will the decisive battle start soon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.29,0:20:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unguarded!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.65,0:20:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't pull it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.04,0:20:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make use of this for now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.18,0:21:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...swords?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.61,0:21:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Three-Sword Style!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.57,0:21:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Purgatory...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.00,0:21:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Onigiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.79,0:22:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.09,0:22:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn... Not before the decisive battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.88,0:23:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,S-Samurai-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.64,0:23:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Luffy tries to elevate his ability to use\Nthe Color of Arms as tough enemies keep assail him!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.41,0:23:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}With this deadly training,\Nhe pushes himself ahead to take down Kaido!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.49,0:23:32.24,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And Zoro is taught a stunning \Ntruth by the woman he saved,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.24,0:23:35.95,Italics,,0000,0000,0000,,and gets to the core of \Nthe incident 20 years ago!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.37,0:23:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the next episode of One Piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.70,0:23:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Zoro, Stunned! The Shocking \NIdentity of the Mysterious Woman!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.39,0:23:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.46,0:23:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.46,0:23:48.46,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,
